---
layout: base.njk
title: In the News
description: Press coverage of the Barnard LADR Lab's research.
---
{% from "macros.njk" import photo %}
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>In the news</h1>
  <p class="lede">Coverage of our research on Nicaraguan Sign Language in print, radio, and online.</p>
</header>

<ul class="news-list">
{% for n in news %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ n.url }}">
      <div class="news-thumb">{% if n.image %}<img src="{{ n.image | img }}" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}<span>{{ n.outlet }}</span></div>
      <div>
        <p class="news-meta">{{ n.outlet }}, {{ n.year }}</p>
        <h2>{{ n.title }}</h2>
      </div>
    </a>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
